Package: nyclion
Title: NYC LION Single Line Street Network
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Kieran", "Healy", , "kjhealy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9114-981X"))
Description: New York City Department of City Planning LION File
    Geodatabase, a single-line representation of NYC streets with address
    ranges and a rich set of administrative, traffic, and geocoding
    attributes. Includes the street segments (multilinestring), node
    points, the node-to-street lookup, and the alternate names table that
    supports geocoding.
